[
    {
        "content": "<p>When we derive an instance on <code>Y</code> from <code>X</code> , the way I understand it works like this (evidence below): the reducibility of the derived instance is the same as the reducibility of <code>Y</code>. However in some cases we want the derived instance to be instance reducible while other instances stay unaffected (e.g I define <code>R := S</code> where the addition is the same but I have a different multiplication/scalar action, etc.), is it possible to do this when making <code>def</code>s? (Note that tagging the whole thing with <code>instance_reducible</code> is <em>not</em> a solution because it doesn't allow any different (non-defEq) instances from the original def.</p>",
        "id": 623117506,
        "sender_full_name": "Edison Xie",
        "timestamp": 1789039693
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">op</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">α</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">op</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">e</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- semireducible carrier — Mathlib's `TopCat.Sheaf` today -/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">YSemi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo1</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">implicit_reducible</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">YImp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo1</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">@[</span><span class=\"n\">instance_reducible</span><span class=\"kd\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">YRed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"n\">X</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Base</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Foo1</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: YImp : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.implicitReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: YRed : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.instanceReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: YSemi : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.semireducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YImp : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.instanceReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YImp._aux_1 : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.implicitReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YImp._aux_3 : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.implicitReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YRed : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.instanceReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YSemi : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.instanceReducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YSemi._aux_1 : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.semireducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">---</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: instFoo1YSemi._aux_3 : Lean.ReducibilityStatus.semireducible</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">show</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MetaM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getEnv</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">env</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">constants</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map₂</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">·.</span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">filter</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">`YSemi</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`YImp</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`YRed</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">||</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">`instFoo1YSemi</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isPrefixOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">`instFoo1YImp</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isPrefixOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">`instFoo1YRed</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">isPrefixOf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toArray</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">qsort</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toString</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toList</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">n</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">names</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">logInfo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">m!</span><span class=\"s2\">\"{n} : {repr (← getReducibilityStatus n)}\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">section</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">explicit_position</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: Tactic `rfl` failed: The left-hand side</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  instFoo1YSemi Nat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">is not definitionally equal to the right-hand side</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  instFoo1Base</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">⊢ instFoo1YSemi Nat = instFoo1Base</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1YSemi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: Tactic `rfl` failed: The left-hand side</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  instFoo1YImp Nat</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">is not definitionally equal to the right-hand side</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">  instFoo1Base</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">⊢ instFoo1YImp Nat = instFoo1Base</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1YImp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1YImp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_implicit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1YRed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_reducible_and_instances</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1YSemi</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instFoo1Base</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">explicit_position</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 623117593,
